00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.000
to show that in God's kingdom, there is perfect happiness.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:30.000
And I mean by perfect happiness, perfect health, perfect wealth, perfect joy.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:46.000
Satan's kingdom is plagued with problem.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:51.000
So, this is, this is what I want you to remember

00:03:51.000 --> 00:04:00.000
always that the distinction, the whole idea is a distinction between God's kingdom and Satan's kingdom

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.000
that God's kingdom has no problems

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.000
once you pass all the required tests

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:14.000
and once you come to the point, this point of perfection, when you are in God's kingdom.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.000
And that Satan's kingdom is plagued with problems.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.000
Our soul grows and develops

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:28.000
and this constitutes the secret of perfect happiness in this world

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:33.000
as you see on the wall there. That's the theme of the new translation.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:39.000
The secret of happiness in this world is a fed, nourished soul.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:46.000
You ate breakfast today, or lunch, or snack or something. You ate something today. You gave your body something today.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:53.000
And the people who did not feed their soul, they have a starving soul

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.000
without feeling the pain.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.000
The pain will show up all at once

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:03.000
